{\b\fs24 Stilleto - Your voice. Anywhere you type.}\par
Copyright (c) 2026 Maravian. All rights reserved.\par
\par
{\b Privacy}\par
Stilleto transcribes speech locally on this computer. Audio is not sent to any server and is not saved to disk unless you turn on "Save raw recordings" in Settings > Privacy. Transcription history is stored only on this PC (%APPDATA%\\Stilleto) and can be turned off or cleared at any time. The only network access is downloading speech models from huggingface.co, and only when you ask for it on the Models page.\par
\par
{\b Pre-release software}\par
This build is provided for evaluation and testing, "as is", without warranty of any kind. Text insertion works in most applications but cannot be guaranteed for every program; Windows does not allow it in applications running as administrator, secure fields or the secure desktop.\par
